# Host turns (src/turn-launch.ts TURN_SLICE) run here, under citadel.slice (8G and 8 cores for the
# server and every turn together). MemoryHigh makes the kernel reclaim from and throttle turns before
# they fill the box and push it into swap (2026-11-10: load ~100 with 19 GiB swapped out). 6G leaves
# the server about 2G of citadel.slice's 8G, and the 29 GiB box still has room for the emulator, the
# Godot editor and the containers. A starting value: tune it after watching MemoryCurrent.
# No MemoryMax on purpose: it would OOM-kill turns. Container turns carry their own --cpus 4 --memory 6g.
[Unit]
Description=Host turns of Citadel

[Slice]
MemoryHigh=6G
